  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7de05702be1743d4c91e09edb76cd6fc, type: 2}
    text: "Verdade, n\xE9? Que pergunta besta..."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7de05702be1743d4c91e09edb76cd6fc, type: 2}
    text: "Tenha um \xF3timo dia!"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c0d71f1534a4dcc468bbb9c8196e348f, type: 2}
    text: Obrigadinha!
